        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="scope" value="Which database, pooler and store hops are encrypted, and whether the client verifies the server. The hop state is written on every edge: TLS verified / TLS unverified / PLAINTEXT. Who issues the edge and identity certificates, and the east-west hops, are in tls-pki-edge; the full per-hop list is the §12.1 table in docs/secrets/cert-manager.md. local-stack is plaintext by design and is not drawn." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="54" width="1280" height="36" as="geometry" />
