        <mxCell id="d_cold" value="PLAINTEXT · S3&#10;cold tier · profiles" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=1;endArrow=classic;flowAnimation=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#334155;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endSize=6;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.33;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="obsdb" target="rustfs">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" x="-0.85">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="880" y="780" />
              <mxPoint x="970" y="780" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_state" value="&lt;b&gt;Reading the hop state&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;TLS verified: the client checks the chain against a CA and checks the hostname. TLS unverified: the hop is encrypted, but the client does not check who answers (sslmode=require, or a driver default of prefer). PLAINTEXT: nothing is encrypted on the hop. Since ADR-089 both CNPG clusters and the DR replica serve &amp;lt;cluster&amp;gt;-server-tls from homelab-ca; every service, worker, migrate init container, seed and authz Job uses verify-full with the CA from its namespace's *-db-ca-trust Certificate, and both poolers refuse plaintext and verify the primary. Keycloak (JDBC prefer, TLS 1.3 measured 2026-10-01), the OpenBao DB engine and pgroles (sslmode=require) are encrypted but unverified, and Temporal is plaintext (pg_hba host, #1296). CNPG's own client CA signs replication and the PgBouncer auth_query cert, not homelab-ca. platform-db's backups take the same plaintext S3 path as product-db's." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="970" width="1280" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_planned" value="&lt;b&gt;Planned, not installed (RFC-0020, provisional)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;S5 per-hop client certs · S9 platform-db clients · S11 RustFS TLS · S12 Valkey auth + TLS. Keycloak, Temporal and OpenBao verify-full: #1296." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1062" width="1280" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
